WEBVTT

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:02.125
What was that? Come again, Logan!

00:00:02.208 --> 00:00:04.500
<i>It's the Nightmare King.</i>
<i>He's coming your way!</i>

00:00:04.583 --> 00:00:05.916
I don't see anyone.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.833
The only thing I see here
is this strange glowing crystal.

00:00:08.916 --> 00:00:10.375
It looks like--

00:00:10.458 --> 00:00:12.125
-It's an egg!
-What?

00:00:12.208 --> 00:00:13.833
<i>An egg!</i>

00:00:16.166 --> 00:00:18.666
This one will be mine!

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.416
Grab it and go! Now!

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.666
Move in!

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.500
Head for the cliffs, to the north!
I'll meet you there!

00:00:27.583 --> 00:00:29.250
And protect that egg!

00:00:31.208 --> 00:00:32.458
No, you don't!

00:00:39.958 --> 00:00:41.208
Logan!

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:43.166
-You made it, Coop!
-Made it?

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:46.416
Why did you want me to come here?
We are trapped!

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:50.416
He's right.
Nowhere to run. Nowhere to hide!

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.750
Now hand over my crystal!

00:00:52.833 --> 00:00:57.291
Ah, ah, ah. My man Cooper's got this
and he will kick your butt!

00:00:57.375 --> 00:01:00.250
Whoa! Careful! I almost dropped it!

00:01:00.333 --> 00:01:04.750
Careful, boy!
You do not want to damage my prize.

00:01:04.833 --> 00:01:08.666
Oh, I don't know if that would be
the worst thing that could happen.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:10.083
Right, NK?

00:01:12.541 --> 00:01:16.291
-Okay.
-No!

00:01:21.458 --> 00:01:23.166
Hah! Told you it was an egg.

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:28.291
You insolent little brat!
You will pay for that!

00:01:43.541 --> 00:01:46.833
Whoo! Somebody's gonna be Dino-sore
in the morning!

00:01:46.916 --> 00:01:50.333
This changes nothing. Attack!

00:01:59.083 --> 00:02:03.250
Cooper! Dude!
That dino is on "fiaya"!

00:02:03.333 --> 00:02:09.041
Oh, I get to name it, right?
Brachiosaurus Infernus!

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:14.458
Whoa!

00:02:14.541 --> 00:02:20.416
Well, it's time for Brachiosaurus
Infernus to go extinct!

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:21.875
Charge!

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.666
Whoa!

00:02:31.875 --> 00:02:36.875
Our work here is done.
Now let's deal with the others.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.458
What the--?

00:02:40.541 --> 00:02:43.708
Brachiosaurus Aeroricus!

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:50.250
-Whoa-ho! Ho-ho-ho-ho! Yeah!
-Whoo!

00:02:53.041 --> 00:02:54.416
Detach!

00:02:56.541 --> 00:02:57.958
Dino Dash!

00:03:00.541 --> 00:03:03.958
-Whoo! Get him!
-Yes!

00:03:12.375 --> 00:03:14.333
Whoo-hoo-hoo!

00:03:18.833 --> 00:03:22.583
Told you!
Come on, let's go find the others.

